<title>USA: Eastman Chemical sees Q3 EPS below estimates.</title>
<headline>Eastman Chemical sees Q3 EPS below estimates.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSPORT, Tenn. 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eastman Chemical Co said Thursday it expects to report third quarter earnings of $1.20-$1.35 per share, compared with analysts' estimates of $1.38-$1.63.  </p>
<p>The company cited significantly lower selling prices and lower-than-anticipated volumes for polyethylene terephthalate (PET), a soft European economy, and recent increases in propane costs.</p>
<p>The company's stock closed at 56-3/8 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Eastman expects to report third quarter results on October 21.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
